Luhukay from Borussia to him still doesn't go out to make the eleventh goal.
Kristoffer Klein presented very well the forced landing of national team player Marko Martin.
Gladbach's player started playing late and failed making a goal.
Everything he wanted to say exactly by reacting to what had happened, he could clearly read from his lips.
I just knew he was right.
