The salvation plan envisages making available resources to purchase so-called "rotten" mortgage shares.
But the sum is going to be paid suddenly but step by step.
As compensation for that, the state has to receive stock option receipts for financial associations that during course development can be charged to reduce the financial burden of the state fund.
Stock courses in Europe and the U.S. continue to decline
Billion’s aid for banks in Europe and the U.S. doesn’t reassure investors.
The course of the shares of the large German bank Hypo Real Estate lowers and negatively influences the Dax.
Despite the salvation of the financial market projected by the state, the U.S. Dow Jones index continues to fall.
Losses from speculated shares of the Hypo Real Estate and Commerzbank caused the German index (Dax) to fall into a large deficit.
Despite the salvation stocks of the federal government share and private banks, the Munich real estate financier’s supply action wasted two-thirds of its value, the Comerzbank lost more than 20 percent.
